{"articleNo":"3074","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=3074&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 2학기 방학 중 근로장학생 선발자 명단 및 유의사항","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.12.21","hit":"9213","attachments":[{"name":"국가근로장학생 시간표 및 출근부 입력 방법.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=3074&attachNo=2435"},{"name":"근로장학생 선발자 명단7.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=3074&attachNo=2452"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"4\">2011학년도 2학기 방학 중 근로장학생 선발자 명단 및 유의사항<br></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">1. 근로기간 : 2011. 12. 22(목) ~ 2012. 02. 29(수)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff\">국가근로장학생</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">은 시간표 입력, 출근부 입력을 숙지하기 바랍니다.<font color=\"#0000ff\">[</font><font color=\"#0000ff\">붙임2]</font></span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 계절학기 시간표 입력기간 : 2011. 12. 22(목) ~ 26(월)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 출근부 입력 : 근로 후 5일 이내 입력가능(미입력시 입력 불가하오니 주의바람)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 한국장학재단 홈페이지 로그인 후 출근부 입력가능</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000\"><font size=\"3\">3. 유의사항</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 2012. 02. 17(금) 졸업자는 2012. 02. 16(목)까지 근로가능</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학적상태(휴학, 제적 등)일 경우 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000\">근로 불가능</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"> (재학생만 근로가능)</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 학기초과자는 재학생일 경우만 근로 가능</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">4. 미선발된 부서에 근로를 희망하는 학생은 희망부서로 연락하여 협의 후 신청바랍니다.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [붙임1]</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">5. 문의 : 478-7065<br><br><br>붙임&nbsp; &nbsp;1. 부서별 근로장학생 선발 명단&nbsp;1부.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 국가근로장학생 시간표 및 출근부 입력방법 1부.&nbsp; 끝.<br><br><br></font><br><br><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2011. 12. 21.<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학&nbsp; 생&nbsp; 처</font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
